{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43254","headline":"宿烟含白露 · 孙頠","name":"宿烟含白露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"㭊㭊有新意，微微曙色幽。\n露含疎月净，光与晓烟浮。\n迥野遥凝素，空林望已秋。\n着霜寒未结，凝叶滴还流。\n比玉偏清洁，如珠讵可收。\n裴回阡陌上，瞻想但淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙頠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}